# Mock-up: a gut in a shrine at night, side view. Altar with offerings under a
# shaman-god painting, candles, paper money and cloth strips hanging from the
# beam, five-direction flags, drum and gong players, the mudang dancing with
# fan and bells, villagers watching (backs to us), the protagonist kneeling.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 320 180
@output ../mockups/gut_shrine_side.png
@preview ../previews/gut_shrine_side_x3.png 3
@fill D
@tiles g tiles_gut.pix
@tiles t tiles_night_school.pix
@legend B g:beam
@legend H g:hanji_wall
@legend h g:hanji_wall_warm
@legend | g:post
@legend m g:mat
@legend F t:floor_top
@legend f t:floor_fill
